       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BILLING.
      *> Calls CUSTLOOK, which is in custlook.cob.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  CUST-ID         PIC X(6) VALUE "C00042".
       01  CUST-NAME       PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "CUSTLOOK" USING CUST-ID CUST-NAME
           DISPLAY CUST-NAME
           STOP RUN.
